<% layout('/layouts/boilerplate') -%>

<div class="container py-5">
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col-12 col-lg-8 mx-auto">
      <div class="card border-0 shadow-md p-4 p-md-5" style="border-radius: var(--radius-xl); background: var(--bg-surface);">
        <div class="border-bottom pb-4 mb-4">
          <div class="d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center bg-danger bg-opacity-10 text-danger rounded-circle p-3 mb-3">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved fs-3"></i>
          </div>
          <h2 class="fw-bold mb-2">Privacy Policy</h2>
          <p class="text-muted mb-0">Last updated: August 2026</p>
        </div>

        <p class="lead text-body mb-4">
          At Wanderlust, we take your privacy seriously. This policy describes how we collect, use, store, and handle your personal information when you use our website and services.
        </p>

        <h4 class="fw-bold text-dark mt-4">1. Information We Collect</h4>
        <p class="text-secondary">
          We collect information you provide directly to us when creating an account, posting property listings, or leaving reviews. This includes your username, email address, property details, location data, and uploaded photographs.
        </p>

        <h4 class="fw-bold text-dark mt-4">2. How We Use Information</h4>
        <p class="text-secondary">
          We use your information to operate, maintain, and improve our services, facilitate host and guest communication, prevent fraud, and ensure security across our community platform.
        </p>

        <h4 class="fw-bold text-dark mt-4">3. Data Protection & Security</h4>
        <p class="text-secondary">
          We implement modern technical and organizational security measures to protect your personal information against unauthorized access, loss, or alteration.
        </p>

        <h4 class="fw-bold text-dark mt-4">4. Contact Us</h4>
        <p class="text-secondary">
          If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, please reach out to our privacy team at <a href="mailto:support@wanderlust.com" class="text-danger fw-bold">support@wanderlust.com</a>.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-5 pt-3 border-top">
          <a href="/listings" class="btn btn-auth-secondary rounded-pill px-4">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left me-2"></i> Back to Stays
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
